    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaCl</mi></math> reacts with conc. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math> to give reddish fumes (B), which react with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math> to give yellow solution (C). (B) and (C) respectively are ;"
